WEBVTT

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.760
"Dreamer A Sangvis High-End Model."

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.220
"Dreamer A Sangvis High-End Model."
M4A1 and the other members of her team

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:12.550
"Dreamer A Sangvis High-End Model."
retreat after being caught
in Dreamer's trap.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.840
retreat after being caught
in Dreamer's trap.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.590
Meanwhile, AR15 realizes that

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.140
the changes that occurred to
her are due to a Sangvis virus,

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.100
and renews her resolve to fight on alone.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.560
This doesn't make sense.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.320
Why reveal your location?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.860
It's obviously a trap.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:34.360
That's no new weapon.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.740
The artillery that attacked
our base is aiming for you!

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.580
Guess you're not as crazy
as Destroyer says.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.920
And you're not as cold as the data says.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.130
I suppose I should give you credit
for your courage in coming here,

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.840
instead of running away.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.300
You're still worth using.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.800
AR15, you've been chosen.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:04.640
I won't betray the first
people to accept me.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:23.450
Do you understand, M4?

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:30.500
I... hated you.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:13.440
Kalina, how long are we going
to be kept waiting here?

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:16.150
I can't say right now.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:20.780
What is bothering Master so much?

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.610
Nothing's bothering me.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.490
I just think that even if we have backups,

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:28.580
it's better to be careful with
how we operate our dolls.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:33.250
"Operate"? You're starting
to get the language right.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:39.010
So, I heard Helian sent you a
support team to help find AR15.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:41.420
Who told you?

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.180
My sweet honey angel.

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.010
What's their name?

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:53.140
"Squad Negev."

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:02.240
Tavor, where are we?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.740
No idea.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:07.780
She's turned off her radar to
keep us from tracking her signal.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.750
But how do we stop AR15 from escaping?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:13.330
We were lucky to find these footprints!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.790
We can handle any number of Sangvis.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.460
I'm a combat specialist, after all!

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:21.920
Galil, what is that?

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.380
A planetarium, probably.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:27.850
Oh, for seeing the stars!

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:32.100
You two, stop standing and keep moving!

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:35.560
Victory is within our grasp!

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:38.820
Our team captain's always so cheerful.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:42.860
I'm the latest model,
and I'm still impressed.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.700
March on! March on!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.880
What's wrong?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.130
You seem down, M4.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.340
Footprints were found nearby.

00:05:04.340 --> 00:05:06.430
We'll see her soon.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.180
And when we do, what then?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:14.310
If we tell her to come home, will she?

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:17.100
And then will everything
go back to normal?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.520
M4...

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.730
She's not that complicated.

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.610
There's probably a bad connection
in one of her parts.

00:05:25.610 --> 00:05:28.820
A few good thwacks,
and she'll be good as new.

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:32.450
Is that how it works?

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:35.830
Yeah. I'm the one saying it,
and I would know.

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:40.670
You'll never find her if you
keep staring at the ground.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.010
Raise your head up and
let's look for her together.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.970
Right.

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.220
This is it?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:49.680
This isn't a base, it's a campground.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.060
No complaining.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:54.430
Galil, stand watch at the rear.

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:56.730
Sure thing.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:59.940
Uzi and the rest of you,
inspect your weapons.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:01.770
On it!

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:06.150
We can't leave until we find AR15.

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:10.070
16LAB's dolls will recover her.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.660
I'm aware.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.950
First, let's request reinforcements.

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:17.120
We can't go any further alone.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.500
What's wrong, Tavor?

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:19.500
That's strange.

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.040
The transmitter module
is giving me an error.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.920
It's not working. I can't use this at all.

00:06:31.550 --> 00:06:32.760
Tavor!

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.720
What was that?

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:37.770
Was that Parapluie?

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.100
I don't know.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.600
So close.

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:47.570
Three more seconds, and I could've
touched that pretty throat of yours.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.860
So you're the one jamming our comms.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.200
What do you want?

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:57.250
Nothing. I just followed
the smell of unripe fruit.

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.370
Oh, yuck.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:06:59.870
Captain Negev!

00:07:03.840 --> 00:07:05.630
My name is Alchemist.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.420
I'll tell you the rest...

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:12.220
...when I'm ripping apart your bodies.

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:13.550
Ew...

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:15.720
Everyone, we're pulling
out from this base!

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.310
There are too many enemies here!

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:20.310
We'll fall back to that planetarium
and wait for reinforcements.

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:23.100
Galil, we'll draw the Sangvis away.

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:26.360
You retreat to an area outside the
jamming radius via another route!

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:27.900
And then report to our commander!

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:28.740
I'm counting on you!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.740
R-Roger!

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:31.950
Let's go!

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:38.830
Commander, Squad Negev
went silent 20 minutes ago.

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:44.000
A moment ago, we picked up a distress
signal from one of their members.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.000
I suggest we change our plan.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:52.930
Let's meet up with them, see what's going
on, and then provide support if necessary.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:55.260
How bad's the jamming in that area?

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:58.390
There are several areas where
we can communicate with you.

00:07:58.390 --> 00:08:01.430
But most of the zone is jammed by Sangvis.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:02.520
Got it.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.900
After you find out what's going on,
you are to report to me.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:08.020
No making decisions on your own.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.480
But, then...

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.990
You have your orders, M4A1.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.360
Roger that.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:19.200
Um, I'll get reinforcements ready, okay?

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:20.700
Please.

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.170
We're here!

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.090
This is where the SOS came from!

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:35.590
Squad Negev should be here.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:36.640
But they're not.

00:08:36.640 --> 00:08:39.100
I followed the signal!

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.770
Don't shoot! Please don't shoot!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.770
A-AR Team?

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.730
That's right!

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.520
Come on out!

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:53.780
Whew. There were Sangvis
here a moment ago.

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:56.110
Think about where you call for help.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:59.700
Don't pick a front-line area
that's crawling with enemies.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:03.080
The area where we were attacked
was cut off by jamming.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.710
I was trying to find the
first place I could contact you!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:08.290
Give me a break.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.460
Can you tell me what's going on?

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.440
Attack! Attack!

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:38.530
Save your ammo! We don't know
when reinforcements will arrive.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:41.330
We're lucky this place is
sturdier than we thought!

00:09:41.330 --> 00:09:44.200
But there's far more of them
than there are of us.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.580
There's little time.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.630
I'm counting on you, Galil.

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:55.670
There are a shit-ton of enemies out there,
and our comms are jammed.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:58.930
I don't know what's
going on at the planetarium.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.680
Alchemist, huh?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:03.140
We can't handle a Ringleader on our own.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.770
But if we go back to report to the
commander, we may not make it in time!

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.440
Y-You can't!

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.020
Everybody's waiting for you!

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.150
Let's split up.

00:10:13.150 --> 00:10:16.530
Big Sis M16, get back to an area
where you can contact the base,

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.780
and have Commander Gentiane
send reinforcements.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.200
SOPII and I will go on ahead.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:24.660
Galil, lead us there.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:25.870
Leave it to me!

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:28.540
What, you're letting me get the scolding?

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:31.750
I'm sorry, but we need to attack Sangvis,

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.750
and distract them from
Squad Negev as much as we can.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.420
I know.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.550
Good luck.

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:41.930
Let's hurry.

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:48.520
They're hanging in there.

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:52.020
It'll be interesting to see
how much longer they last.

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:53.820
They just keep coming!

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:56.780
Don't they know when to give up?

00:10:56.780 --> 00:11:00.450
I thought this mission
was going to be easier!

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.910
About that...

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:08.040
Negev, what do you think about AR15,
the T-Doll that vanished?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.540
I feel bad for her. That's all.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.340
She was unknowingly fed
the Parapluie program

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:17.050
and forced to leak the
location of the base.

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:19.510
She probably fled out of regret, but...

00:11:19.510 --> 00:11:23.550
It would take a strong T-Doll
to be able to do that.

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:26.810
What about it?

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:28.810
If it was just an information leak,

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.560
then it's not as scary as
the rumors say, but...

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:36.900
Is there any need to bring in a T-Doll
that made a mistake like that alive?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:43.450
AR Team was developed by 16LAB.

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:46.530
And they can't do anything
to make 16LAB look bad.

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:50.710
Also, their neural clouds
are a little different.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.460
When they die, it's really over for them.

00:11:54.460 --> 00:12:02.430
But is Helian really using all these
personnel just to find a single traitor?

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:06.720
Negev?

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:14.650
They're already right on top of us.

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:16.060
Prepare to seal the corridors.

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:18.230
We'll seal ourselves in
the planetarium hall.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.070
I'll show you how a specialist fights!

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.450
We made contact with Squad Negev,

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.500
but M4 and SOPII have gone
on ahead to rescue them.

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:34.710
They were supposed to talk to me first.

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.750
Sorry.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:41.970
So, I want you to look
at the data Galil shared.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:44.300
How are there so many?

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.390
There's a lot, right?

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:46.720
Too many.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:50.680
Even with Alchemist there as Ringleader,
one Sangvis couldn't control that many.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:54.190
So there's a base somewhere
that's controlling some remotely?

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.060
Yes.

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:59.690
I'm looking at what I think might be it.

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:01.400
I'm not being jammed right now,

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:04.530
which means if you sent reinforcements,
we could probably take it.

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:06.740
If we can take it down
and cause some chaos,

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:10.370
that'll make life a lot easier
for Negev and M4.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:11.660
What do you think?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.540
Fine. Sending reinforcements.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.620
I appreciate it.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:18.420
I'll be waiting.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.630
Kalina, tell G36's team to get out there.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.840
Right, Commander!

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:29.350
There are just too many.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.730
Ammo! Anyone have ammo left?

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.860
That's not good.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.610
Did Galil make contact with base?

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:51.660
Do they think we've
already been wiped out?

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:01.040
We can see Sangvis firing,

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.880
but nothing coming from Negev.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:05.720
Did we not make it in time?

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.180
No... that's not true!

00:14:09.260 --> 00:14:11.100
Either way,

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:14.810
with so many there,
I'm not certain we could help.

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.850
M4, this is M16.

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.560
Do you read?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:24.110
Big Sis M16? How are you
able to contact me?

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:26.570
I took out a Sangvis base.

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:28.860
Any change in the dolls near you?

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:33.410
Over half are having
functionality problems.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:36.450
I can see that many
have shut down entirely.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.460
Guess I was right.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.460
How's Squad Negev?

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:42.960
Right now, we don't know.

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.590
Fine, M4.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:46.880
Commander!

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.680
I'm sending reinforcements.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.890
You stay there.

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:56.810
But Commander, if Squad Negev is
still inside, there's no time to waste!

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:59.230
Alchemist is still unharmed, right?

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.690
I can't let you fight her
without reinforcements.

00:15:03.650 --> 00:15:06.320
There are no replacements for you.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:12.030
Can we head in when the
reinforcements arrive?

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:13.490
I promise.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:15.290
Th-Then we'll be fine!

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.830
Our captain's a combat specialist!

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.830
And Tavor and Uzi are both really strong!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.880
Galil...

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:28.970
What?

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.050
What is it, M4?

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:32.300
I don't know.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:36.220
I'm seeing light from the planetarium
where Squad Negev's holed up.

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:37.680
It's flashing.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.350
Flashing?

00:15:39.350 --> 00:15:41.560
Can you send me your visual data?

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:42.810
Yes.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:48.860
That's...

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:50.320
Morse code.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.700
Morse code?

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.410
Negev Team's sending a message.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.990
Soldiers in the military are required
to memorize Morse code

00:15:56.990 --> 00:16:00.500
so they can use it to communicate
when other means aren't available.

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:05.090
"S-q-u-a-d u-n-h-u-r-t."

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.090
Squad unhurt?

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:09.840
They're alive!

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:13.970
Commander, over half the
Sangvis are inoperative.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:16.430
And Squad Negev still survives.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:18.890
We can launch a pincer attack
with them and M4's team.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.810
This is our one chance.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:24.940
Commander!

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:30.320
AR Team, you are permitted
to link up with Squad Negev.

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.280
Right!

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.410
But you are only to distract the enemy.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:36.200
Maintain distance from Alchemist.

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.620
Roger.

00:16:37.620 --> 00:16:40.870
G36, move to M4's coordinates.

00:16:40.870 --> 00:16:42.870
Understood, Master.

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:44.420
Thank you, Commander!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:45.500
Thanks!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.790
I owe you one, Commander!

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.050
They're all such selfish girls.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:56.800
You're gonna be stuck
with them a long time.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:04.600
Do you think they saw it?

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:09.860
I don't know, but we did what we could!

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:12.360
Something happened to the Sangvis!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.610
Half of them stopped moving!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.910
And we're getting support fire
from far back in the rear!

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:21.240
Could it be help?

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:24.960
Of course everything worked out! I'm here!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:26.370
Be grateful to me!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:27.830
Yup!

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:31.340
I won't show any mercy just
because the enemy's obsolete!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.950
Negev!

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:04.000
I wasn't expecting the Sangvis
Ringleader to run that easy.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:08.080
Be careful. She might
be planning something!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.460
It's fine!

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:11.800
M16 will be here soon!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:15.630
If we just had AR15 back,
it would be perfect.

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:20.470
Where is she?

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:23.180
It's almost like she's avoiding us!

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.680
I am avoiding you.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:31.610
You always make a mess of things.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.190
AR15?

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:39.910
M16 told you so many times to watch out,
or you could be ambushed like this.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:41.370
You never change.

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:45.000
AR15, what are you doing?

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.920
I'm pretending to have a tearful reunion.

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:55.340
Commander Gentiane, M4 and SOPII vanished.

00:18:55.340 --> 00:18:56.510
What do you mean?

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.510
Did they make contact with Negev?

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:02.890
No, the two of them split off from
Galil just before they met up.

00:19:02.890 --> 00:19:06.350
Hello? M16? Commander? Can you hear me?

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.520
I found SOPII.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.690
Negev? Were you able to contact them?

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:14.900
No. All I found was SOPII's signal.

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.190
I have nothing on M4!

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:20.410
I'll send the coordinates now!

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.660
That's close.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.910
Commander, can I head there?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:24.780
Be careful.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:28.580
A huge number of Sangvis just
appeared out of nowhere in that area.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:31.670
Alchemist is back?

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:35.380
There were far more than Alchemist
has the authority to command.

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:39.050
That's strange. There are no other
enemy bases in the area.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:42.430
Their actions are chaotic.

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:44.890
I don't know what they're after.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.970
If they're not after us,

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:49.230
we should be okay.

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:52.440
Commander, I'm heading to SOPII after all.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.480
G36's group will meet with Negev.
How about that?

00:19:58.650 --> 00:19:59.740
Permission granted.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:03.200
Just get me information on
M4 and SOPII as fast as you can.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.780
Yeah. I know.

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:06.240
I'll search the database

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:09.830
for Ringleaders besides Alchemist
who could be in command there.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.710
Thanks.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.710
Things have gotten complicated.

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:17.000
Yeah. But more than that...

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:19.210
Huh?

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.590
Something's bothering me.

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:24.720
It's like something's hiding
on the other side of this map.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:36.520
You awake?

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:38.900
Who are you?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:41.700
The one who's come to get you.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.490
Why?

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.200
Sheesh... You are a handful.

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.030
I'm going to bring you to meet the others.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.410
Your friends are waiting.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:51.710
Friends?

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.580
There are no candidates
in my memory module

00:20:53.580 --> 00:20:57.500
who meet the definition of "friend".

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.760
Does that mean I still
don't have any friends?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:04.470
Then I'll be your first friend.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.930
Sheesh... This sucks.

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.060
You're AR15?

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.480
You know me?

00:21:14.480 --> 00:21:20.360
The weapon you carry matches
the one in my memory module.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:21.650
I see.

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:24.360
You don't look happy.

00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:26.360
That's not true.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:30.870
Being your friend was my first order.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.910
Showing a positive attitude
is part of that order.

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:38.750
But if you're happy, shouldn't you smile?

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:41.670
Then order me.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:44.670
If you order me, I'll do it.

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:47.760
You want me to order you?

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:51.100
If there's anything you want me
to do, just give the order.

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:53.600
You have the authority.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:56.730
Everything was prepared for your coming.

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:03.230
Wake up, M4A1.

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.370
SOPII! Wake up!

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:13.450
SOPII!

00:22:15.410 --> 00:22:18.960
M16? Where's M4?

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:22.670
I only saw you here.

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:24.130
What happened?

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:27.970
We were together a moment ago.

00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:31.970
But we found AR15, and then...

00:22:31.970 --> 00:22:33.850
You were attacked?

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:35.980
Do you remember what they were like?

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:39.900
Of course I remember!

00:22:39.900 --> 00:22:43.980
M16! I just don't understand anymore!

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:46.570
M16, are you still there?

00:22:46.570 --> 00:22:49.240
Yeah. I linked up with SOPII.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:53.080
I just got a new order from Helian.

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:54.490
What kind of order?

00:22:54.490 --> 00:22:56.910
To call off the search for AR15.

00:22:56.910 --> 00:22:59.420
The situation is extremely dangerous.

00:22:59.420 --> 00:23:04.340
All Griffin T-Dolls within the S09
area are to leave immediately!

00:23:06.050 --> 00:23:07.260
Can you stand?

00:24:43.020 --> 00:24:46.610
Episode 12: "Comet 02."
